# Supabase e S3

- Browser: `createClient` de `@/lib/supabase/client`
- Server (sessão): `createClient` de `@/lib/supabase/server`
- Service role: só no server, casos privilegiados explícitos
- Schema novo = migration em `supabase/migrations/`
- Upload/delete via APIs + `lib/aws/s3.ts`; clone usa `cloneTemplateImages`

Nunca expor `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` ou `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` ao client. Spec: `.cursor/specs/infrastructure.md`.
